Deosil is a neighborhood of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. The one robber taken alive after the ambush at a rest-stop gas station said his crew had bought their guns, marked with [[Org/Sable and Suns/index|Sable and Suns]] tokens, there from a man named Lark.
